// Overall, support for data elements is a little bit brittle.
// However, if you use data in simple ways only,
// there is a high chance of working.

= Pool
== Lane 1

# Start
- middle
. End

== Lane 2
# Start
- Middle
. End

// While not 100% necessary, I recommend to keep all data elements grouped
// after the pools and lanes.
OD This is Data <-l1s
OD This is other Data ->l1m
OD Data can span lanes <-l1e ->l2s
OD Many connections ->l2s First Label ->l2m Label ->l2e With labels even
